# Project Overview

## Project Name
RORA Art Center - Student Tracking System

## Purpose

This project was developed to digitalize the student management processes of RORA Art Center.

The application allows administrators to:

- Register new students
- Track weekly lessons
- Manage monthly payments
- Generate monthly reports
- Store all data locally

## Scope

The system is designed for small and medium-sized music education centers.

## Technologies

- C#
- .NET Framework 4.7.2
- Windows Forms
- XML Serialization

## Current Status

Current Version: v1.0

The application is fully functional and currently under documentation and maintenance improvements.